WEBVTT

00:00:27.301 --> 00:00:31.301
www.titlovi.com

00:00:34.301 --> 00:00:35.268
Toboe...

00:00:35.836 --> 00:00:37.531
Let's go back,
Hige.

00:00:52.787 --> 00:00:56.086
I no longer
feel pain.

00:00:57.391 --> 00:01:02.124
Jaguara's poison is slowly
eating away at me.

00:01:10.805 --> 00:01:15.376
Your kind are wolves who debased
themselves by becoming human...

00:01:15.376 --> 00:01:18.777
...and were driven out
of Paradise.

00:01:21.248 --> 00:01:25.514
You cannot return
to your original form.

00:01:52.146 --> 00:01:53.443
Mister...

00:02:00.988 --> 00:02:02.455
Pops...

00:02:09.263 --> 00:02:10.491
I'm sorry...

00:02:12.133 --> 00:02:13.122
I...

00:02:15.236 --> 00:02:21.471
I shot you,
so why are you...

00:02:24.745 --> 00:02:30.115
I promised Blue...

00:02:30.718 --> 00:02:33.448
...that I'd protect you.

00:02:34.722 --> 00:02:37.350
But I couldn't...

00:02:38.759 --> 00:02:40.226
I'm sorry...

00:02:43.364 --> 00:02:54.138
I wish I could've stayed at your side like Blue
my whole life, looking out for you...

00:02:57.077 --> 00:03:03.346
I wish we all could have gone
to Paradise together...

00:03:08.389 --> 00:03:12.655
Let me sleep here...

00:04:04.378 --> 00:04:06.039
That was...

00:04:12.620 --> 00:04:14.178
Now I get it...

00:04:15.189 --> 00:04:17.987
That... was you?

00:04:25.399 --> 00:04:27.867
That was you...

00:04:34.408 --> 00:04:35.238
Toboe!

00:04:36.644 --> 00:04:38.908
Toboe! Toboe!

00:04:43.617 --> 00:04:45.346
You dumb kid...

00:05:03.470 --> 00:05:05.631
Hey!

00:05:07.608 --> 00:05:10.441
Hey!

00:05:10.911 --> 00:05:12.208
What's going on?

00:05:14.415 --> 00:05:16.007
Where are you guys?!

00:05:19.586 --> 00:05:20.678
You!

00:05:25.926 --> 00:05:28.417
So, you're
a mere human?

00:05:41.108 --> 00:05:44.134
I know you have the stone
that opens Paradise.

00:05:44.578 --> 00:05:46.239
What are you
waiting for?

00:05:46.647 --> 00:05:50.447
I have been waiting
for a wolf. For <i>you.</i>

00:05:50.984 --> 00:05:51.814
What?

00:05:52.519 --> 00:05:55.079
You will soon lose everything,
as I have lost everything.

00:05:55.689 --> 00:06:00.023
You must discard everything
that you now possess.

00:06:00.561 --> 00:06:04.327
That is the law
of the new world.

00:06:07.034 --> 00:06:08.501
The seal is broken.

00:06:09.570 --> 00:06:10.628
Hurry.

00:06:11.138 --> 00:06:13.800
Paradise is right
under your nose.

00:06:56.517 --> 00:06:58.075
- Pops!
- Toboe!

00:07:00.053 --> 00:07:01.350
Pops...

00:07:06.760 --> 00:07:09.092
This can't...
How did this happen?

00:07:23.143 --> 00:07:24.610
Pops...

00:07:38.225 --> 00:07:39.283
Quent...

00:07:44.731 --> 00:07:45.698
Why?

00:07:46.733 --> 00:07:49.133
Why did this
have to happen...?

00:07:57.544 --> 00:07:58.568
Toboe...

00:09:02.476 --> 00:09:06.776
We have to hurry.
He's trying to reach Paradise.

00:09:07.781 --> 00:09:10.045
He's heading for
our Paradise.

00:09:11.952 --> 00:09:13.544
Isn't that strange?

00:09:14.421 --> 00:09:18.881
Why doesn't he open up his own
Paradise? One for the Nobles?

00:09:21.295 --> 00:09:23.490
The Tree of All Seeds
is over there.

00:09:24.831 --> 00:09:28.392
The Tree of All Seeds
told this one.

00:09:31.772 --> 00:09:33.672
We have to go.

00:09:35.242 --> 00:09:37.506
We don't have time
to stand around.

00:09:40.480 --> 00:09:42.641
How about you?
What are you going to do?

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:47.251
After coming all this way,
what are you planning to do?

00:09:50.257 --> 00:09:52.487
Where are you going
to run and hide this time?

00:09:55.996 --> 00:10:00.763
I'm not running. I just figured that I'm
not needed on this journey anymore.

00:10:01.435 --> 00:10:03.995
That's all
I was thinking.

00:10:06.807 --> 00:10:09.503
None of us
is indispensable.

00:10:10.410 --> 00:10:13.573
Nothing is indispensable.

00:10:14.815 --> 00:10:16.510
You are.

00:10:17.751 --> 00:10:20.618
You're the only one
who can open Paradise.

00:10:24.224 --> 00:10:27.716
You're the only one
who can go all the way there.

00:10:31.031 --> 00:10:34.194
Even <i>Tsume</i> must have
realized that by now.

00:10:36.803 --> 00:10:38.532
I'll go.

00:10:40.340 --> 00:10:45.573
Even if Paradise turns me away,
I'll go as far as I can.

00:10:46.246 --> 00:10:48.942
So you have
to come, too.

00:10:51.752 --> 00:10:54.448
I know you want to go!
Stop making excuses!

00:10:55.722 --> 00:10:56.848
Blue...

00:11:10.003 --> 00:11:13.029
It's starting to fall apart...
Even this close to the center.

00:11:15.208 --> 00:11:17.870
It looks like we should
get a move on, all right.

00:11:19.146 --> 00:11:21.114
Don't worry
about me.

00:11:21.448 --> 00:11:23.882
When it starts to look like
I'll slow you down,

00:11:25.452 --> 00:11:27.420
I'll take care
of it myself.

00:11:27.921 --> 00:11:30.549
I want to go as far
as I can, too.

00:11:31.958 --> 00:11:33.186
Go on ahead.

00:11:35.962 --> 00:11:38.931
I want to talk
with the runt for a bit.

00:11:41.568 --> 00:11:42.967
We understand.

00:12:09.262 --> 00:12:10.251
Hige.

00:12:13.433 --> 00:12:17.062
I've betrayed
you guys before.

00:12:20.440 --> 00:12:24.706
I'm scared.
I might betray you again.

00:12:28.582 --> 00:12:33.019
No matter what you do to us now,
I won't think of it as a betrayal.

00:12:33.520 --> 00:12:36.387
No matter what it is,
I'll just accept it.

00:12:39.760 --> 00:12:42.320
When I think you're trying to kill me,
<i>then</i> I'll fight you.

00:12:44.564 --> 00:12:46.998
Sure.
I'll hold you to that.

00:12:57.644 --> 00:13:01.239
You know, you've
grown pretty big...

00:13:01.882 --> 00:13:07.252
When I first met you, you were
still a scrawny little pup.

00:13:08.321 --> 00:13:11.552
I knew back then that you loved humans
more than anything, but I...

00:13:12.492 --> 00:13:17.259
No, maybe I never did
understand anything.

00:13:19.032 --> 00:13:25.369
But I...
Are you listening, Toboe?

00:13:26.540 --> 00:13:30.772
You asked me about my scar once, remember?
About how I got it.

00:13:32.212 --> 00:13:35.704
It's the mark
of my sin.

00:13:42.189 --> 00:13:46.148
I abandoned my packmates and ran
as they were being killed.

00:13:54.634 --> 00:13:58.900
And I was run out
of the pack.

00:14:00.841 --> 00:14:02.809
I didn't need
any friends.

00:14:03.410 --> 00:14:05.241
I never
trusted them.

00:14:05.946 --> 00:14:08.744
I always betrayed
those around me.

00:14:10.483 --> 00:14:12.644
Until I met you guys.

00:14:14.521 --> 00:14:18.013
I wanted to take you
to Paradise.

00:14:19.159 --> 00:14:22.925
You were the one who
brought me all this way.

00:14:24.164 --> 00:14:26.530
C'mon, Tsume!
Let's go!

00:14:27.500 --> 00:14:30.196
I believe in you,
Tsume.

00:14:31.204 --> 00:14:34.332
I won't whine anymore.

00:14:35.108 --> 00:14:37.076
Yeah, I know.

00:14:38.144 --> 00:14:39.611
I know.

00:14:44.484 --> 00:14:47.681
Old man, take care
of the runt for me.

00:14:50.090 --> 00:14:51.318
See ya.

00:15:04.271 --> 00:15:06.967
Am I the only one who's
having trouble breathing?

00:15:07.307 --> 00:15:08.968
No, so are we.

00:15:09.643 --> 00:15:11.577
We're pretty high up,
that's why.

00:15:12.012 --> 00:15:16.642
We are almost there. The Tree of
All Seeds is waiting up ahead.

00:15:51.017 --> 00:15:53.815
The Tree of All Seeds
has been alive this whole time.

00:15:54.621 --> 00:15:56.919
It has felt pain
all this time.

00:15:57.791 --> 00:16:01.659
But now, it is
breathing freely.

00:16:18.511 --> 00:16:19.705
Thank you.

00:16:29.122 --> 00:16:31.283
The crest of
House Darcia?

00:16:40.867 --> 00:16:44.963
That's what this was...
This is the Tower of the Seal.

00:16:45.572 --> 00:16:51.477
It says here that the Nobles built this
to seal off the wolves' Paradise.

00:16:52.345 --> 00:16:53.471
Seal?

00:16:54.614 --> 00:16:58.482
"The seal is broken"...
That's what he said to me.

00:17:00.020 --> 00:17:02.682
He was starting
to turn into a wolf.

00:17:03.390 --> 00:17:04.823
Darcia, you mean?

00:17:05.592 --> 00:17:07.856
He had a wolf's eye.

00:17:08.194 --> 00:17:11.857
When Jaguara's... When the
Noble's Paradise started to open,

00:17:12.832 --> 00:17:14.993
he gave up on
going there himself.

00:17:15.435 --> 00:17:18.836
He's trying to
become a wolf.

00:17:21.007 --> 00:17:23.976
And if he opens
Paradise first...?

00:17:24.778 --> 00:17:26.973
Our kind will have
no future.

00:17:29.649 --> 00:17:34.211
Hey, in that book,
how is Paradise described?

00:17:34.854 --> 00:17:37.152
It doesn't say anything...

00:17:37.424 --> 00:17:41.053
The last page
is blank.

00:17:42.495 --> 00:17:45.055
Over there.
The first mountain.

00:17:46.099 --> 00:17:48.124
That is the entrance
to Paradise.

00:18:27.907 --> 00:18:30.000
Are you okay?

00:18:30.510 --> 00:18:34.810
Yeah... I'm sorry.
Don't worry about me, go on ahead.

00:18:35.348 --> 00:18:37.612
I'll take my time
as I climb.

00:18:38.017 --> 00:18:40.281
Just a little more, and you'll reach
a spot where you can rest.

00:18:48.661 --> 00:18:50.219
It's beautiful...

00:18:51.331 --> 00:18:53.561
Can you see that,
Cher?

00:19:08.748 --> 00:19:12.684
I tell you now the words
of the Red Moon.

00:19:13.620 --> 00:19:17.784
The wolf was born from the Great Spirit,
and man became the messenger of the beast.

00:19:18.324 --> 00:19:21.987
He lives his life
in silence,

00:19:22.729 --> 00:19:25.527
where the blessing of the blood
of the gods is bestowed upon him.

00:19:25.965 --> 00:19:27.762
- Hey!
- Hold on!

00:19:29.035 --> 00:19:35.941
For all my tough talk, I guess I won't
be able to make it with you to the end...

00:19:37.310 --> 00:19:46.275
I guess the area up ahead is a place
I won't be able to set foot in.

00:19:46.719 --> 00:19:48.021
Hang on tight!

00:19:48.021 --> 00:19:50.080
Stay back!
Don't try to come down!

00:19:53.059 --> 00:19:56.460
I'm not afraid.

00:19:57.830 --> 00:20:02.028
You wolves will open up
the next world for us.

00:20:02.702 --> 00:20:05.170
I have faith
that you will...

00:20:06.472 --> 00:20:10.374
I didn't need the gun,
after all...

00:20:18.017 --> 00:20:22.188
The flower wins the favor
of the lord of the night,

00:20:22.188 --> 00:20:23.621
and gives off
her scent.

00:20:24.157 --> 00:20:30.653
Firm and eternal in countenance, her form
is as a lily-white, supple maiden.

00:20:48.014 --> 00:20:54.476
She distills and condenses time
until all is a precious, frozen mass.

00:21:34.060 --> 00:21:36.528
It is then that the beast
shall appear.

00:23:05.151 --> 00:23:06.252
Next Time
<i>  </i>
<i>  </i>
<i>  </i>

00:23:06.252 --> 00:23:07.153
Next Time
<i>  </i>
A journey's end is always
a little depressing.

00:23:07.153 --> 00:23:08.677
A journey's end is always
a little depressing.

00:23:09.422 --> 00:23:12.289
It was a long trip, but now that it's over,
it seems like the blink of an eye.

00:23:12.892 --> 00:23:14.757
Anyway, it's been
pretty fun.

00:23:15.261 --> 00:23:16.125
See ya.

00:23:16.562 --> 00:23:18.621
If it's meant to be, I hope we meet again.

00:23:21.621 --> 00:23:25.621
Preuzeto sa www.titlovi.com
